# Working style

- Godot 4.7, 2D, GDScript only.
- The current local project is the source of truth. Read the relevant `.gd` and `.tscn` files before changing them. Do not invent from chat summaries or old ZIPs.
- Change one understandable slice at a time. No unrelated refactors or speculative features.
- After edits, say what changed, why, and how Hugo can test it in the editor.
- Code inspection is not a Godot run. Never claim a runtime test that was not performed.
- Assume a beginner reader. Comment *why*, not the next line of code.
- Edit files in place with small diffs. When showing a snippet in chat for Hugo to paste, give a complete replacement function and name its file.
